# Practice Listening Tests

## Entry
- Home → Practice Listening → catalog of 3 tests
- Catalog: `practiceListeningCatalog.ts`
- Hub: `PracticeListeningHub.tsx`

## Modes
### Test 1
- **Learn** — Lead-in → adverts → task advice → Table 1–5 (audio) → Predicting → Short 6–10 (audio) → Follow-up
- **Exam** — Table → Short → combined score
### Test 2 (Te Papa)
- **Learn** — Discuss → vocab → predict → Map 1–6 (2.1) → Matching 7–10 (2.2) → language → gap follow-up (2.3) → notes
- **Exam** — Map → Matching → results
- Session: `PracticeListeningTest2Session.tsx` · data: `practiceListeningTest2.ts`
### Test 3 (Friendships)
- **Learn** — Photo discuss → meet friend → Q1–4 (3.1) → MC tips → Q5–10 (3.2) → language → follow-up
- **Exam** — Q1–4 → Q5–10 → results
- Session: `PracticeListeningTest3Session.tsx` · data: `practiceListeningTest3.ts`
### Test 4 (Urban planning)
- **Learn** — Photo → discuss → synonyms match/fill → Q1–10 (4.1) → follow-up
- **Exam** — Q1–10 (matching + flow chart + summary) → results
- Session: `PracticeListeningTest4Session.tsx` · data: `practiceListeningTest4.ts`

## Audio
- Player: `AudioPlayer.tsx` (Play/Pause, seek, time)
- After **Check**: green/red blanks + correct answer beside wrong ones; **Tapescript** side panel
- Reuse this pattern for every listening practice task

## Engines (reuse)
### Job adverts / vocab word box
- Word chips → fill sentence blanks; one word each

### Task advice table
- Tips 1–8 → place into Before / During / After columns

### Table completion
- Audio + HTML table with numbered blanks · ≤2 words

### Short answer questions
- Audio + numbered prompts · ≤3 words and/or numbers

### Map labelling (Test 2)
- Map image + letter bank A–I + selects for Q1–6; script after Check

### Matching letters (Test 2)
- Purpose bank A–F + selects for Q7–10; letters used once

### Predicting (T/F or discuss)
- T/F chips (Test 1) or discuss + suggested answers (Test 2)

## Content
- Textbook wording + teacher keys only
